  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: At the school entrance, a familiar tall figure is leaning against the wall
      with a sketchbook he quickly tucks into his bag.
